 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's trade balance with China has worsened since 2010, moving from -19.8 million euros to -633.9 million euros in 2025.",
  "This represents a change of +3,104.4% over the period 2010 to 2025.",
  "The trade balance was least negative in 2013 at -18.8 million euros, marking the peak before it deteriorated further.",
  "There is no seasonal or projection note provided for this data.",
